WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.300
Every factory is a little puzzle.

2
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:09.600
Orders pour in, machines queue up… and deadlines slip away.

3
00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:15.300
What if you could test every idea, before touching the real shop floor?

4
00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:17.800
Meet Simulatte!

5
00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:22.850
Discrete-event simulation for production and intralogistics, in Python.

6
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:30.800
Sketch machines, jobs and routings, then brew release policies like LumsCor, DRACO, or ConWIP.

7
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.300
Same shop, same seed. Switch the release policy, and late jobs drop from fourteen percent… to two.

8
00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:46.350
Add warehouses, and a fleet of little AGVs, with batteries, traffic and charging.

9
00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:51.600
Run hundreds of seeds in parallel, or let a reinforcement-learning agent take the wheel.

10
00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:57.300
pip install simulatte, or try it right in your browser, at simulatte.dev

11
00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:00.000
Go on… brew your first simulation.
